00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:08.900
No.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.900
Or throw spaghetti all over the wall.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:22.340
I wouldn't be too worried about Schemi.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:24.260
He hasn't won the contest yet.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:27.560
And if he does win, no one knows what the first prize is.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.980
He's acting just like those mischievous...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:37.060
freight cars. Thomas had to learn all about them. What happened? Well, before Thomas knew where he

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:47.520
was, they'd go running on ahead just like Schemi. I'll tell you about it. Thomas the tank engine

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:54.300
wouldn't stop being a nuisance. Night after night, he kept the other engines awake. I'm tired

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:59.870
of pushing coaches. I want to see the world. The other engines didn't take much notice.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.820
for Thomas was a little engine with a long tongue.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.560
One night, Edward came to the shed.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.850
He was a kind little engine and felt sorry for Thomas.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.430
I've got some freight cars to take home tomorrow.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.930
If you take them instead of me, I'll push coaches in the yard.

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.040
Thank you, said Thomas. That will be nice.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.810
Next morning, Edward and Thomas asked their drivers,

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.980
and when they said yes, Thomas ran...

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:40.780
Now, the freight cars are silly and noisy.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.360
They talk a lot and don't attend to what they are doing.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.810
And I'm sorry to say they play tricks on an engine

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.150
who is not used to them.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.110
Edward knew all about the freight cars.

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:53.890
He warned Thomas to be careful,

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:56.550
but Thomas was too excited to listen.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.590
The shunter fastened the coupling, and when the signal dropped, Thomas was ready.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:13.010
The conductor blew his whistle, answered Thomas, and started off.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.590
But the freight cars weren't ready.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.780
Oh, oh, they screamed.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.260
Wait, Thomas, wait.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.620
But Thomas wouldn't wait.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.020
Come on, come on, he puffed.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:26.040
All right, don't fuss. All right, don't fuss, grumbled the cars.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:54.760
Thomas began going faster and faster we he whistled as he rushed through Henry's tunnel hurry hurry called Thomas

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:59.870
He was feeling very proud of himself, but the cars grew crosser and cross

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:06.020
At last, Thomas slowed down as he came to Gordon's Hill.

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:27.710
Steady now, steady, warned the driver as they reached the top.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.880
He began to put on the brakes.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.400
We're stopping, we're stopping, called Thomas.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:41.040
No, no, no, answered the cars, bumping into each other.

00:21:41.220 --> 00:21:42.700
Go on, go on.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.340
Before the driver could stop them, they had pushed Thomas down the hill

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:49.000
and were rattling and laughing behind him.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:53.400
Poor Thomas tried hard to stop them from making him go too fast.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.040
Stop pushing, stop pushing, he hissed.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.080
But the cars took no notice.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:21:59.980
Go on, go on, they giggled.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:11.340
in their silly way as the station oh dear what shall i do cried thomas they rattled straight

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:21.250
through and swerved into the goods yard thomas shut his eyes i must stop when he opened his eyes

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:29.940
he saw he had stopped just in front of the buffers there watching him was sir topham hack

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:32.550
What are you doing here, Thomas, he asked.

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:39.530
I've brought Edward's freight cars, Thomas answered.

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:42.180
Why did you come so fast?

00:22:42.360 --> 00:22:43.400
I didn't mean to.

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:45.650
I was pushed, said Thomas.

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:49.850
You've got a lot to learn about freight cars, Thomas.

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:52.460
After pushing them about here for a few weeks,

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:54.760
you'll know almost as much about them as Edward.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:59.170
Then you'll be a really useful engine.

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:09.270
Look, J.B. King is about to announce the winner.

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:10.370
Good luck.

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:13.530
All right, everyone, gather on.

00:23:14.470 --> 00:23:15.900
Now, just hold on.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.320
I've gone over all the entries,

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:20.820
and I've got two finalists here.

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:23.770
I tell you, I just can't decide.

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:25.520
I like them both.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:27.340
This one says,

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:29.980
we may be small, but we're nice.

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:39.040
something true and decent about that on the other hand we have the big mean

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:49.120
motion machine I like the sound of that may not be as true but it's gutsy

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:57.130
I'll tell you what I'm going to put these two entries into this basket and

00:23:57.630 --> 00:23:59.760
whichever one I pick

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:00.870
will be the winner.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:05.440
And the winner is...

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:07.840
Peep.

00:24:08.870 --> 00:24:09.270
Peep.

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:10.810
Peep.

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:11.870
Peep.

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:12.910
Peep.

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:14.960
I like the sound of that.

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:16.300
It's different.

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:21.480
All right, everybody stop saying peep, peep, peep.

00:24:26.960 --> 00:24:27.780
The trees again.

00:24:28.570 --> 00:24:29.970
This doesn't mean the trees are going to be all...

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:31.840
That's sure a good sign.

00:24:32.780 --> 00:24:35.400
I've always wondered who planted those apple trees.

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:37.000
It was Johnny Appleseed.

00:24:37.940 --> 00:24:39.020
Johnny Appleseed?

00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:41.140
Do you know that for a fact?

00:24:44.390 --> 00:24:46.130
Do you know for a fact he didn't plant them?

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:48.380
You have a point there.

00:24:49.320 --> 00:24:50.320
Johnny Appleseed, huh?

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:52.720
Oh, Mr. King, the winning entry.

00:24:53.790 --> 00:24:54.650
Ah, yes, of course.

00:24:54.790 --> 00:24:55.350
Back to business.

00:24:56.430 --> 00:24:57.650
Peep, peep, peep.

00:24:58.880 --> 00:24:59.960
It has a...

00:25:01.830 --> 00:25:04.820
I like that in a railroad slogan.

00:25:05.470 --> 00:25:06.630
It gets my vote.

00:25:07.170 --> 00:25:08.690
Let's see, who wrote this winning entry?

00:25:11.620 --> 00:25:16.780
Tex, Rex, Didi, Tito, and Grace.

00:25:17.170 --> 00:25:17.970
Who are these people?

00:25:19.870 --> 00:25:21.960
So what do they win? $2,500?

00:25:23.600 --> 00:25:26.620
Where in the name of brake fluid did you get that idea?

00:25:26.890 --> 00:25:29.970
No, the first prize...

00:25:30.090 --> 00:25:32.130
is a ride with the engineer

00:25:32.130 --> 00:25:33.730
of the Rainbow Sun,

00:25:33.910 --> 00:25:34.890
the pride of the lion.

00:25:36.130 --> 00:25:37.010
Rainbow Sun!

00:25:37.630 --> 00:25:38.830
But since the winning entrance

00:25:38.830 --> 00:25:39.970
don't appear to be here,

00:25:40.910 --> 00:25:42.150
how would you kids like to go?

00:25:42.570 --> 00:25:45.810
What about you?

00:25:47.270 --> 00:25:48.010
I'm so good.

00:25:48.620 --> 00:25:49.720
I want to write down.

00:25:51.370 --> 00:25:52.190
Would you like an apple?

00:25:52.980 --> 00:25:54.200
Well, what do you know?

00:25:54.590 --> 00:25:55.410
We won!

00:25:59.360 --> 00:25:59.980
Yeah, with a...

