Just a-singin' girl, don't you know

00:27:38.580 --> 00:27:49.760
You've gone 500 miles

00:28:00.284 --> 00:28:02.284
Memphis, Tennessee

00:28:04.060 --> 00:28:07.300
It's halfway home and we'll be there by morning.

00:28:09.340 --> 00:28:12.780
Through the Mississippi darkness, rolling to the sea

00:28:14.108 --> 00:28:14.448
